{"id":"364ab8ad1d9d7918","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-hif-total-functional.md","title":"HIF 的全数值泛函归约等价","display":"thm-hif-total-functional — HIF 的全数值泛函归约等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-hif-total-functional","aliases":["20-thm-hif-total-functional"],"display":"thm-hif-total-functional — HIF 的全数值泛函归约等价","chapter":"5","section":"5.6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.6.4 的完整双向内容","source_printed_pages":[125],"source_pdf_pages":[160],"depends_on":["[[20-df-total-functional-reduction]]","[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","[[20-df-use]]","[[20-thm-effective-finite-cover]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-hif-total-functional"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-hif-total-functional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hif-total-functional — HIF 的全数值泛函归约等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.6.4 的完整双向内容"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>160</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8c1d508dc8efefc\" href=\"?note=b8c1d508dc8efefc\" title=\"20-df-total-functional-reduction\">20-df-total-functional-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"927f4ead14ec3c2d\" href=\"?note=927f4ead14ec3c2d\" title=\"20-thm-effective-finite-cover\">20-thm-effective-finite-cover</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；全函数量化于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b8c1d508dc8efefc\" href=\"?note=b8c1d508dc8efefc\" title=\"20-df-total-functional-reduction\">20-df-total-functional-reduction</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"84785d7ea3ad1a08\" href=\"?note=84785d7ea3ad1a08\" title=\"20-thm-cantor-compactness\">20-thm-cantor-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega}\\)</span> 采用直接上游的数值全泛函定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"927f4ead14ec3c2d\" href=\"?note=927f4ead14ec3c2d\" title=\"20-thm-effective-finite-cover\">20-thm-effective-finite-cover</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-total-functional}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [f\\le_T A\\Rightarrow f\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega}A].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-total-functional}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [f\\le_T A\\Rightarrow f\\le_{\\mathrm{tt},\\omega}A].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 计算原程序的停止时间，该全函数有普通可计算最终界；修补有限例外为逐点界。在任何 oracle 上只按该界模拟，超时赋 0，得到全数值泛函并在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上原样输出。反向：对全泛函固定输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，其停止前缀覆盖 Cantor 空间；紧致性给有限覆盖，有限搜索可找到一个层和时限，使所有该层串上的计算停止。取这些有限输出的最大值，形成普通可计算逐点支配函数。不能只把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的图是集合 tt 归约当作全数值泛函的全性。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.6.4 的完整双向内容；印刷页 125；PDF 第 160 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-total-functional-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"b8c1d508dc8efefc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-total-functional-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-cantor-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"84785d7ea3ad1a08","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-